# recorded model answers for the docs pages, committed on purpose: `nbs/03_agent.ipynb` runs a real
# Agent against them, and without them the page would need a model. Record with
# RISHI_RECORD_CHAT=1 uv run nbdev-test --path nbs/03_agent.ipynb

